[Challenges: Logic vs Physics]
  - DECIDED(sysml_first): SysML (Step 0) is mandatory before Step 1 (Formal).
  - DECIDED(test_derivation): Tests must be derived from spec, not hand-written.
  - INVESTIGATING(parametric_mapping): Mapping RAM budget to Block properties in SysML.

